  the coordinator's shutdown completes within its global deadline in both
  cases.
- AC24 (R6): `--check-config` refuses `scenes.provider: {kind: websocket,
  url: "ws://192.0.2.1:4455"}` naming `scenes.provider.url` and not the
  value, accepts `ws://127.0.0.1:4455` and `wss://example.invalid:4455`; the
